// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1024054381" "You got ahold of all the parts before the Clockwork could steal them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P829419562" "You got the parts! Great!<br><br>Wait. You fought off another band of hostile Clockwork? That's unsettling.<br><br>Wait, wait, wait... Wait.<br><br>When you said the Clockwork were talking you meant talking in their maintenance code, right?<br><br>No? What? They knew you by name?<br><br>Oh no... if they knew you by name, and that you were coming for those parts... that means they might know who I am and...<br><br><color yellow>Susan</color>..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3763799736" "{HeroName}! It isn't a malfunction in the hard lines... Gah, hold on, let me explain.<br><br>I sent the schematics over to a friend of mine at <color yellow>Omnitek</color> to take a look at them while you were getting these parts. We were discussing them over a secure chat channel when she suddenly went offline.<br><br>I tried to contact her over the hard lines but I couldn't get through. I figured there was a communication disruption due to Resistance activity down in the tunnels again, but now that I check, Omnitek has gone completely silent. Whoever is behind this knows I transfered those schematics to Susan and now they've gone after her!<br><br><color orange>Please, {HeroName}, get Susan out of there before it's too late!</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3234753873" "Check out Omnitek"
// SendOffString :
"P2116318861" "If anything happens to her it's my fault. I'll alert the PPD while you're en route, hopefully they can lend you a hand.<br><br>And {HeroName}, please... please get her out of there safely. Susan doesn't know it, but she is more to me than just another colleague."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1320962870" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Bait and Switch</color>"

