// SaysList :
"P1524124335" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white> {HeroName}, this is Parson. The signal disappeared a short time before you arrived. <t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>I don't see it showing up anywhere else in the city.<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>Continue your search of Megalith, there has to be some reason the signal was there."
// SaysList :
"P3554447381" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white> Stolen Clockwork parts? Why would the Syndicate be investigating that?<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>They must know something, {HeroName}. Find out what's going on from their leader."
// SaysList :
"P56714731" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>Burn marks? Yeah, sounds like a Clockwork plasma spray.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>So the Clockwork raided Megalith and attacked the Syndicate there.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>Find out what the Syndicate were doing there."
// SaysList :
"P1497007340" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>A powerful psychic? Something isn't adding up. Hold on.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>...<t=8 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=8><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>It looks like the Seers did report a psychic anomoly in Megalith around the time the signal appeared, but it vanished soon after so no patrols were sent.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>Right now the only answers we're gonna get are from the Syndicate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - InnerDoughnut 
