// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SaysList :
"P1365070497" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white> {HeroName}, Parson here. Something weird is happening...<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>There... *static*... a lot of... *static*... it's disrupting comm...*static*...<t=6 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>...Whoa! Psychic *static* the charts! *static* careful...*static*<t=4 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> {HeroName}...You should not have come here.<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> My quarrel is not with you, {HeroName}. It is with another.<t=4 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> Parson and Beck were not harmed. <t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> Leave this place now, or your fate will be to join he who is most deserving to die.<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> You cannot stop me, for I am without number. You cannot kill me, for I do not live.<t=6 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=6><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> I am inevitability, {HeroName}. I am the rhythmic tapping of Death's fingers upon the booming drum of vengeance! <t=1 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=1><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> I... <t=1 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=1><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white> Am... <t=2 caption x= 0.4 y=0.5 d=2><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>Metronome!"
// SaysList :
"P1379074511" "<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white> {HeroName}? Can you hear me?<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>I lost communications with you. Are you alright?<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color deepskyblue><bgcolor white>Whoa? The psychic signal... it's... it's gone."

